        "custom_liquid_XYE4Yd": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"accordion\">\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"accordion-trigger\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n      <span class=\"accordion-left\">\n        <svg class=\"info-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <strong>What is it?</strong>\n      </span>\n      <svg class=\"chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <polyline points=\"6,9 12,15 18,9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>A quick-apply powder that bonds to every hair strand — even the ones you can't see — to instantly fill in thin and balding spots. No surgery, no waiting months. Just full, natural-looking hair in seconds.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"accordion-trigger\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n      <span class=\"accordion-left\">\n        <svg class=\"info-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <strong>What if my scalp looks completely bare?</strong>\n      </span>\n      <svg class=\"chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <polyline points=\"6,9 12,15 18,9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>Even if your scalp looks bald, it still has ultra-fine hairs you can't see. RIZEN™ Densify's micro-fibres bond to those invisible strands, instantly filling gaps and creating natural-looking volume.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"accordion-trigger\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n      <span class=\"accordion-left\">\n        <svg class=\"info-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <strong>How do I use it?</strong>\n      </span>\n      <svg class=\"chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <polyline points=\"6,9 12,15 18,9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>Start with dry hair. Tap a small amount directly onto thinning areas. Blend with the applicator or your fingertips until it disappears into your hair. For all-day hold, finish with a light mist of spray.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <button class=\"accordion-trigger\" onclick=\"toggleAccordion(this)\">\n      <span class=\"accordion-left\">\n        <svg class=\"info-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"17\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\"0.8\" fill=\"#111\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <strong>Shipping & Guarantee</strong>\n      </span>\n      <svg class=\"chevron\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n        <polyline points=\"6,9 12,15 18,9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n    <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n      <p>We ship every order fast and worldwide. Standard Shipping – Delivered in 7-10 days – $2.99. All RIZEN™ products are backed by our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .accordion {\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 600px;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-item {\n    border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-trigger {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 18px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-left {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-left strong {\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n\n  .info-icon {\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    min-width: 20px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  .chevron {\n    width: 18px;\n    height: 18px;\n    min-width: 18px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-trigger.open .chevron {\n    transform: rotate(180deg);\n  }\n\n  .accordion-content {\n    display: none;\n    padding: 0 0 16px 30px;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-content.open {\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .accordion-content p {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #444;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  function toggleAccordion(btn) {\n    btn.classList.toggle('open');\n    const content = btn.nextElementSibling;\n    content.classList.toggle('open');\n  }\n</script>"
